    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Holy light explodes around you in a 30-foot Emanation, harming your enemies and healing your allies. Each creature of your choice in the Emanation makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 5d6 Radiant damage on a failure or half as much on a success. Each other creature in the Emanation regains 3d6 Hit Points.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Both the damage and the healing increase by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 4.</p>",
